 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"One Page Website Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a one-page website?\", \"a\": \"A one page website puts all of a site's content on a single page that visitors scroll, usually services, reviews, prices, and a contact form. Links in the header jump to each part instead of loading a new page. It also goes by one pager website or single page website.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I build a one page website with a builder?\", \"a\": \"Start with a list of your sections and the fields your form needs, then hand that list to the builder. In Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a>, you type it as a prompt and get the full page back, form included. A drag-and-drop tool has you place each block by hand instead.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I build a one-page website for free?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Emergent's free tier covers building and publishing a one page website at a live URL. Connecting a custom domain uses credits, and the domain name itself is registered with a registrar for a set term and renewed to keep it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I host a one-page website for free?\", \"a\": \"On a static host. GitHub Pages, for one, serves HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files free on a GitHub Free account, though its terms rule out sites run mainly for commercial transactions. A static host serves files and nothing more, and an inquiry form needs a backend to store what visitors send.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I make money with a one-page website?\", \"a\": \"Yes, if the page leads to one paid action, such as a booked session or a quote request. On a page built with Emergent, each inquiry lands as a row in a database you own. Add a field asking how the visitor found you, and you can see which ads or posts bring in paying work.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best single page website?\", \"a\": \"There is no single winner, and curated galleries such as One Page Love sort great one page websites by category. Start with your own trade and note how few fields each form asks for. Then check where the best one page websites send a visitor after the form, such as a thank you page.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do great one page websites include?\", \"a\": \"They say what the business does in the first line, in the words a customer would search for. Reviews sit next to the prices instead of on a separate tab. The page ends on one next step, whether that is a form, a phone number, or a booking button.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a one page website theme?\", \"a\": \"A one page website theme is a ready-made design for a site builder or CMS that sets the type and the section layouts of a single scrolling page. You install it and swap in your own text and photos. Before you commit to one, check where its contact form sends the entries.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find one page website templates?\", \"a\": \"One Page Love keeps a curated gallery of one-page websites, a good place to compare layouts before you pick a template. Free one page website templates and paid ones both need your own photos and copy before they look like your business. A prompt is the other route: describe your sections and Emergent builds a layout for your business, not a sample you adapt.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are good one page website ideas?\", \"a\": \"A wedding RSVP page works well as a one-pager, with the venue and schedule on top and a form for each guest's meal choice below. A clinic can list its hours and take appointment requests, and a tutor can post rates next to a lesson request form. A launch that only needs a teaser and an email field is closer to a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/splash-page'>splash page</a> than to these one page website examples.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}